    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have mastered a miscellany of minor magic.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Extra Cantrips or Orisons<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> At each mythic tier, you may add a new cantrip or orison to your list of spells known, or you may add the mythic version of a 0-level spell which you know to your list of spells known.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-extra-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
